  "question": {
    "text": "The values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi></math> such that the system of equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></math> has no solution, are:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
